)\n\n**Pre- and post-execute methods section:**\n- Fixed the code example: it referenced an undefined variable `on_ice` instead of `tasks_to_skip`, so the documented snippet would raise a NameError if a reader copy-pasted it\n- Added a cross-reference to the 'Creating a custom Operator' how-to, as suggested in the issue\n\n**Setup/teardown comparison:**\n- Fixed grammar: 'used to before setup or cleanup operations' -> 'used to run setup or cleanup operations'\n\nNote: I saw this was claimed during the Airflow Summit contributors workshop a month ago, but no PR followed, so I went ahead. Happy to close this if someone has one in flight.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/73412/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/73412/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]]
